# ── Firebase Data — SELECTIVE IGNORE ────────────────────────────────────────
#
# DO commit (needed for deployment):
#   firebase_data/images/          ← local product images (CDN)
#   firebase_data/processed_json/  ← products.json (local-first data)
#
# DO NOT commit (sensitive data: leads, visitor IPs, analytics):
firebase_data/raw_json/
firebase_data/summary.json
firebase_data/report.txt
